 "about": "The task board (seimei/tasks.py, crates/core/src/tasks.rs). Each scenario starts from seed (the board as it stood on 2026-10-21) or its own start and runs its steps in order. A step: do (the operation) with args, then expect. expect keys: result (subset of what the operation returned; the tool returns {text, error}), error (the operation fails with this message), tasks / projects ({id or name: subset, or null when gone}), count ({project: tasks in it}), data (subset of the board's next and other), current ({worker: task id or null}), queue ({owner: ids not done, in queue order}), first_ids, total, nexts_has / nexts_not, text_has / text_lacks (on the result's text, or the drift line). In a subset, null matches null or missing and \"<set>\" anything but null.",
